---
<!-- ======= Hero Section ======= -->
  <section id="hero">
    <div id="heroCarousel" data-bs-interval="5000" class="carousel slide carousel-fade" data-bs-ride="carousel">

      <ol class="carousel-indicators" id="hero-carousel-indicators"></ol>

      <div class="carousel-inner" role="listbox">

        <!-- Slide 1 -->
        <div class="carousel-item active" style="background-image: url(assets/img/slide/slide-1.jpg)">
          <div class="container">
            <!--<h2>Welcome to <span>Divya Health Care</span></h2>-->
            <p style="font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #fff; text-align: left; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9b2890, #6a1b86); border-radius: 10px; margin: 0; word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">
    Divya Health Care is a state-of-the-art gastroenterology clinic dedicated to providing exceptional care for digestive health. With a patient-centered approach, the clinic offers a serene environment that blends modern medical expertise with compassionate service. Specializing in the diagnosis and treatment of a wide range of gastrointestinal disorders, Divya Health Care is equipped with the latest technology and a highly skilled team of professionals. Our mission is to promote optimal digestive health through personalized care, ensuring that each patient feels comfortable, well-informed, and on the path to better well-being.
</p>


          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 2 -->
        <div class="carousel-item" style="background-image: url(assets/img/slide/slide-2.jpg)">
          <div class="container">
            <h2>About Us</h2>
			 <p style="font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #fff; text-align: left; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9b2890, #6a1b86); border-radius: 10px; margin: 0; word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">
    At Divya Health Care, we are committed to excellence in the field of gastroenterology. Our dedicated team of healthcare professionals strives to provide comprehensive and compassionate care for all your digestive health needs. We understand that each patient is unique, and we take a personalized approach to treatment, ensuring that our patients receive the highest quality care and support. From the latest in diagnostic technology to a welcoming and comforting environment, Divya Health Care is focused on delivering a seamless healthcare experience. Our goal is to improve the health and well-being of every individual we serve, making a lasting difference in their lives.
</p>

                       </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 3 -->
        <div class="carousel-item" style="background-image: url(assets/img/slide/slide-3.jpg)">
          <div class="container">
            <h2>Vision</h2>
             <p style="font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #fff; text-align: left; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9b2890, #6a1b86); border-radius: 10px; margin: 0; word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">
    Our vision at Divya Health Care is to become a leading center of excellence in gastroenterology, providing innovative, patient-centered care that improves the quality of life for individuals suffering from digestive disorders. We aim to continually advance in medical technology, research, and treatment methodologies, ensuring that our patients receive the most effective and compassionate care possible. Through dedication, expertise, and a focus on holistic wellness, we envision a future where every patient can enjoy optimal digestive health and well-being.
               </p>
                     </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <a class="carousel-control-prev" href="#heroCarousel" role="button" data-bs-slide="prev">
        <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon bi bi-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </a>

      <a class="carousel-control-next" href="#heroCarousel" role="button" data-bs-slide="next">
        <span class="carousel-control-next-icon bi bi-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </section><!-- End Hero -->